DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The xxbbff driver provides support for a paravirtual disk interface
     "Blkfront", native to the Xen hypervisor.

     During attach the xxbbff driver will ask the hypervisor to switch all con‐
     figured virtual disks over to the Blkfront interface regardless of the VM
     configuration.

